    1. Small eyebrow text:
    WHAT YOU GET
    
    2. Large serif headline:
    Everything you need to build muscle + lose belly fat.
    
    3. Supporting paragraph:
    Clear training.
    Simple nutrition.
    Real check-ins.
    Built to keep progress moving — even when you plateau.
    
    4. Small highlighted sentence:
    Supplements are optional.
    
